                    insight_conscious:      `Conscious capital: you turned purpose into a measurable strategy — material priorities, value-creating initiatives funded within R$28M, and credible assured disclosure. Brand trust recovered toward 72 on real substance, not a louder adjective.`,
                    insight_greenwash:      `Greenwashing trap: trust was propped up by spin while real stakeholder value or verified disclosure lagged. The NGO's day-60 follow-up will be about exactly that gap — this is the recovery that collapses the moment it is fact-checked.`,
                    insight_delisted:       `Premium SKUs delisted: by the day-45 review your reporting credibility was too low for the retailers to accept a “verified” plan. Real action without assured, broad disclosure did not pass the ESG-compliance clauses.`,
